00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:59.810
No way! That monster...! A monster
like that shouldn't appear near Akiba!

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.510
Gnoll Spearman

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.510
Rank: Raid

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:04.060
All I can say now is that
we shouldn't act impulsively.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.600
Let's split up and
check the surrounding area.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:09.060
We need to gather as
much information as possible.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.440
Right!

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:17.780
Labyrinth in Akiba

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:15.350
"Labyrinth in Akiba."

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.850
They really are all gone.

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:23.150
Marielle, Hien, and all the others...

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:26.310
I wonder if Marielle overslept.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:29.060
There's no way Henrietta wouldn't be up.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:30.600
They really must have disappeared!

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:36.060
But why...? Why did we alone remain?

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.560
The telepathic link isn't working, either.

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:40.690
I wonder where Akatsuki and Nyan-ta are.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:44.190
The shrimp is chaperoning
the young ones' next hunt,

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:47.020
so I think she's with Toya and the others.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.270
In any case, let's go back
to our Guild house.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.730
If we don't get lost,
we'll get there soon.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:54.100
Yeah, if we don't get lost.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:57.400
The streets are now a maze
and the sky looks like that, too.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.020
What happened to Akiba?

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.600
Looks like we've been
thrown into a dungeon.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:05.600
"Thrown..."? But we're in--

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:08.480
I found Furry Dandy!

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.690
Chief!

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:15.520
Hm? What the heck?

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:18.770
A station? Akiba Station?

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:20.310
Morning.

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:24.310
Cut the chit-chat.
Why in the heck are we...?

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.100
I remember we were drinking.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.270
But how did we end up here?

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.400
Mr. Isaac!

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:36.520
Oh? Were you drinking with us?

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:42.190
This is...

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:45.190
It means this isn't the usual Akiba.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.150
In other words, this is...

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:48.120
{=11}Rat Man

