As we thought, they're not here.
Both Princess Rayneshia and her attendants.

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:09.230
We didn't even see a single
Person of the Land on our way here.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:10.440
It can't be...

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.270
The People of the Land disappeared?

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.020
It's possible we might be the ones...

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.230
What?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.020
Nothing. Is the telepathic link
still not working?

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:23.900
No, it's not working.
I think Rieze is headed here too, though.

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.650
They're coming this way.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.060
Dammit! We came out
at the wrong place again!

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.150
Bastards!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.100
William! Check the surrounding area!

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:45.690
Yeah!

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:49.560
Don't let your guard down!
I can still sense them!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.850
Hm?

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:10.280
Despair Genius

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:07.190
Is this the guy the Villain
was talking about?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:10.280
Ereinus: Genius

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:10.280
Rank: Raid

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:10.350
Are you a subject for veneration?

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.850
What's he saying? Gibberish?

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:15.400
Mr. Isaac. I'll cast Reactive Heal on us.

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:19.810
We don't need it. He may be a Genius,
but he's a low-level one.

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.150
Here he comes.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.230
What?!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:31.980
My strength...!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:56.190
My strength is gone!

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:58.150
Watch out, Takayama!

00:05:58.560 --> 00:05:59.980
Enough already!

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:02.550
What?

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.480
This sound is...

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:10.850
We can see the Guild Building in
the south. So we're in the north block!

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.230
I thought we were headed
in the opposite direction.

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:17.520
We might be incompatible with Akiba.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.020
We thought it had gotten easy to make
a trip here from Susukino, and now this.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.230
I wonder if the others are okay.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:25.560
It'd take more than this
to bring them dow--

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:26.810
Dinkuron!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.160
Cerberus

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.160
Rank: Raid

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:33.150
Take this! Paralyzing Blow!

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:40.060
That was level 65.
We can handle one monster, but...

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.650
The problem is, it was raid ranked.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:45.100
Based on the display,
that was a full raid monster.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.100
We need to gather comrades, too.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.310
Scatter!

