00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:55.770
Let's do this!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.650
What?!

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.150
Please don't let your guard down.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:18.480
You should withdraw!

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:20.440
William!

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:23.400
Let's withdraw!

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:28.270
What's going on? My body feels heavy!

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.770
Yeah.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:32.520
Anyway, let's go inside.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:40.770
Hold on a sec... Hey...

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:41.520
This place...

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.810
I'm purrty sure this isn't our kitchen.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:48.900
Does this mean we were
randomly thrown somewhere again?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.940
Let's take a little break.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:55.350
It doesn't look like we can meet up
with Minori and the others so easily.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:05.560
It's started working.
My eyes are already like binoculars.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.940
I'll keep a lookout over
the surrounding area.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:10.900
In any case, Aero Fay Drop, huh?

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:14.150
You sure have a rare item.

00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:19.270
When I see rare items,
I can't help but buy them.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:22.650
Yeah. There are many people like that.

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:24.770
I'm kind of like that, too.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:31.100
Right? Shiroe also...
bought so much like that, so...

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.650
But...

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.650
Items will tell you when to use them.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:40.060
If you wish to win,
you'll know when to use them.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:41.730
I'm sure of it.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.190
What Shiroe said was right.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:50.400
I see some Adventurers!

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.900
They all are level 35.

