00:08:57.350 --> 00:09:01.810
There shouldn't even be level 50
or less Adventurers in Akiba

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:05.230
because that's what the
Round Table Conference instructed.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.350
Their levels are reduced?

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:12.100
I don't know, but if the levels higher
than a certain level have been reduced...

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:13.980
Shiroe and the others, too...?

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:18.810
If that's true, then we're a
bit higher level than them now.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:25.730
I'm keeping level 59 maybe because
I reduced it with the Teacher System.

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:29.650
Then even if we could meet up
with Shiroe and the others...

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:32.190
They'll actually end up
being a burden to us.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:33.900
Oh no...!

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:37.310
So we just have to do our best.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.770
"We" have to?

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:41.560
That's right.
We have to do it by ourselves.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.230
Right!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:57.190
What's going on?

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:58.770
This is a raid.

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.350
That figures.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:05.350
We should avoid fighting!

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.650
Enough already!

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:13.440
Don't stop!

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.310
The blinder should be wor--

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.520
It's not?!

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.690
What's going on?!

