00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.100
William Massachusetts

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.100
Elf

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.100
Assassin

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:27.350
You now know where I'm coming from.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:32.020
Facing full raid monsters, there
are only the four of us at level 35, huh?

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.400
It looks like our chance is very slim.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.600
Yeah, but...!

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:38.850
If we just die, it'll be a total loss.

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.310
Yeah. I'll attack first!

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:44.770
I'll record the encountering enemies
and grasp their characteristics.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:48.560
Let's see what you can do,
Miss Golden Supreme Commander!

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:50.940
If we draw out information
by fighting them,

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:53.230
we can eventually turn
that defeat into a win.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.850
All of our levels got reduced to level 35?

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.400
Did you notice the chime-like sound?

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:04.690
You know, the kind you hear when your
level is reduced with the Teacher System.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.310
Then it happened that time?

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.310
Is this a Genius's doing, too?

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.770
Do you remember the letter from Roe2?

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.940
The last paragraph that seemed
to have been talking about Geniuses?

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:20.560
Oh yeah, I remember! She said
the monsters on the Moon were used.

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:26.850
They are Travellers like us but
are intelligent entities around Rank 2.

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.310
When coming to this world,

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:33.650
they made use of the preexisting monstrous
forms on the Moon with high combat skills.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:37.900
I thought that these monstrous forms
were the monster data

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:42.600
in the new expansion pack
"Novasphere Pioneers,"

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:47.310
and that Geniuses were using
the bodies of the monsters in Elder Tales.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:49.600
That makes sense, right?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:54.020
The Geniuses that appeared so far are
quite similar to Elder Tales' monsters.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:59.650
I think mediums are something they need...
no, it's essential to them.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.560
So here's what I thought.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:04.650
Based on the sizes of the
previous expansion packs,

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:08.190
I guessed that several new races
were added to the existing monsters

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:12.060
and the number of new raid boss
monsters were 50, at most.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:16.190
Well, if it's one like the usual
expansion packs, that's about right.

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.480
That's why I assumed that

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:22.770
if it was anything like that,
we could handle whatever situation arose.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:23.300
But...

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.730
Are you saying that's not the case?

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:28.850
Just like how we, the Adventurers,
were able to act to our advantage

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.150
because we knew the game rules,

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:35.100
they started using the system of the game.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:38.440
Geniuses can also become stronger
by using a similar method to Oral Arts.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:43.900
Some enemies' existences themselves
might even be like Oral Arts.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.100
That's crazy...!

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:47.060
Shiroechi, don't tell me...

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:51.850
Right. This time, they're using
the Teacher System to their advantage.

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:53.770
All Adventurers of
a certain level or above

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:55.460
Adventurer

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.460
Adventurer

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.460
Adventurer

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.460
Adventurer

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:58.100
probably get their levels reduced to 35,
which is our current level,

00:12:55.460 --> 00:13:01.960
Shiroe

00:12:55.460 --> 00:13:01.960
Human

00:12:55.460 --> 00:13:01.960
Enchanter

00:12:55.460 --> 00:13:01.960
Guild Master, Log Horizon

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:02.770
so now they can't handle the weapons
and equipment for above that level well.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:07.270
This is an attack of the Oral Arts
Geniuses created in their own way.

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:12.150
Oh, is that it?

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:15.100
There's no need to worry about it, Shiroe.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.310
What?

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.150
We're the Adventurers
in Elder Tales, right?

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:22.400
We've been to tons of raids, remember?

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.440
I heard from Hiko-pippi.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.060
Hiko-pippi?

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:31.560
That's Kazuhiko. I heard about
the Tea Party's raid theory from him.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.810
I don't rememburr it, though.

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:35.560
Oh, c'mon!

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:38.350
"There's no such word
as 'defeat' in our dictionary

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:41.810
because we're always
on our way to victory!"

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:44.900
Oh?

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:47.270
You must be thinking of something else.

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:51.060
It was probably just another
random thing Kanami said.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:55.650
Shock! And I thought
those were nice words!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:03.770
See? Shiroe's starting to relax.

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:05.940
You might be right.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.810
We still don't have enough information.

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:11.600
But... let's make a move first!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.660
Suifuu Mansion

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.660
Akiba

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.660
Japan Server

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.310
I knew it.

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:23.690
I thought I'd be able to see someone
from the Round Table if I came here.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.690
Came from the Cathedral?

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:29.440
Yeah. No matter how many times
I get revived, it doesn't feel good.

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:33.100
But thanks to it, I could come back here.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:35.690
So is the princess okay?

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.900
Yes. I asked her to stand by on alert.

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:42.770
Did you guys fight and
die on the other side, too?

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.770
Yes, right at this place.

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:50.350
The damage caused by that
fight isn't here in this garden.

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:53.850
It means the change in the landform
that happened in the other Akiba

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:56.190
isn't applied to this one.

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:58.400
Then that place is...

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:02.810
Yes. I think it's probably an Instance.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:08.550
Akiba

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:08.550
Japan Server

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:08.550
Akiba

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:05.310
Um... hold on a sec.

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:08.940
"Instance" is a temporary space, right?

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:13.600
A space created when multiple parties
are about to coincide in the same dungeon?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.730
That's right. In this space,

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:20.520
you can fight monsters without
being inturrupted by other parties

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:26.520
and keep treasures all to yourself.
It's like a zone for your exclusive use.

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:29.400
It doesn't look like
we can go any further.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:32.270
But we obtained a piece of information.

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:33.690
Yeah, indeed.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:35.230
What information?

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:37.850
The kingpin is in there.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.690
It looks like it.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:43.600
There are many midsize Guilds
with many new members in there.

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.980
Like the Crescent Moon Alliance.

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.060
Serara...

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:51.850
Right. It does not seem like the
People of the Land are affected at all.

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:56.770
On the contrary, it became a stir
that the Adventurers disappeared.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:59.900
I'm told there's nothing
unusual in Maihama, either.

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:02.940
It appears that they're
purposely targeting Akiba.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.520
The Villain's prediction proved right.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.810
Our enemy is Despair Genius,
Ereinus, level 65.

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:13.730
Did you fight him? That's an important
piece of information, you know.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:17.310
Even if it's important, we don't have
a way to give it to the other side.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:20.230
Those of us who got
kicked out once can't go back.

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.440
What are you saying?

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:26.350
There's a rule that we can't rechallenge
a raid for a certain period of time.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:28.440
But on the other hand...

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:34.850
The opposite could happen, too. You could
wake up there the following morning.

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:39.100
But our levels remain reduced.

