00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:38.470
{=34}Wolf Fang

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.690
Even if we could go back,
the outcome is clear.

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:46.480
It seems like we're being played,
and we're at their mercy.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.190
Are you saying there is nothing we can do?

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:52.520
Unless someone over
there resolves it, yeah.

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:55.480
I don't know how many
can remain there, though.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:08.770
What was that?

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.150
There are more coming!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:12.850
Litka! Leila!

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:16.230
Useless sisters!

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:16.680
Tetora!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.270
Scissors!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.020
Four o'clock!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:25.650
"Scissors" is a cooperation tactic
where you switch enemies.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:28.520
This one single yell decides
how you should move.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:35.150
Shiroe!

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:40.850
Activate Castle of Stone!

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:44.850
It's a defense skill that voids
all sorts of damage for ten seconds.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:48.560
Since it is "all sorts," it addresses
the level difference problem.

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:03.980
How pathetic, fighting like this
against enemies of this level...

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.980
Even so, that was quite something.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:12.650
You reduced its Hit Points
quite a bit, so it helped a lot.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.810
This is incredible. It's got the info on
the monsters they've encountered including

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:19.520
races, characteristics
and even weaknesses.

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:20.940
Is that enough?

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:23.520
It opened up more possibilities.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.980
We can win.

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.900
I'm glad to hear that.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:31.480
Tetora. Cast Pacification and
remove Lelia and Litka's hostility.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.060
Roger that!

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.940
Pacification!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:43.690
So the Ancients are also
dragged into this space, huh?

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:48.690
Sorry. Sorry. Teto-Teto. Shiro-Shiro.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:49.980
What's the matter?

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:54.810
Sorry that Litka is stupid.
Sorry that they found us.

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:58.440
I am very sorry. Shiroe. Tetora.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:02.730
It's my fault. It was me who they found.

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:07.440
You dummies. If you're worried about
things like that, you won't be popular.

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.940
You won't be able to become
a starlet for the entire galaxy!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:19.440
Sorry, Teto-Teto! Sorry for
losing lots and lots of scales!

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:18.720
What?

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:23.770
Sorry for losing lots
of everyone's scales.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:29.690
It was fun when you all came to the
Underground Empire and played with us.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.520
You guys remember me?

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:39.020
Teto-Teto. You're a good singer.
You gave us lots of scales.

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:42.850
You brought more of them right away.
You were always singing!

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:44.650
I couldn't think of it.

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:48.770
No. I had never even thought about it.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.480
I was just facing these two as
game characters around that time.

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:55.230
To think that they remember us...

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:02.100
It's just natural, but these sisters
have been living in this world.

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:07.020
Yeah. They've been waiting all this time
for us to come play with them.

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:11.270
We were the ones
who had forgotten about them.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:15.520
I wanna say this is a nice story,
but I only have bitter memories...

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.190
But it's kinda...

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:18.600
Wait...!

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:21.480
These girls remained at level 65.

