00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:28.810
Shiro! More appeared!

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:33.230
It is Akatsuki's turn to chaperone
the younger ones, right?

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:35.400
Any possibility that
she uses the Teacher System?

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:40.100
I'm sure she does, but...
this is no time to worry about them.

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:43.730
Have more possibilities opened up?

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:49.600
Yep. There are still many young ones
brimming with potential.

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:53.440
And maybe Akatsuki, too...

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:58.900
She doesn't have much experience
in raids, but she's still strong.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:04.190
Listen carefully, Lelia, Litka.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:07.980
I have a favor to ask of you two.
Find Minori and Toya.

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.150
Isuzu and Rundelhaus, too.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:12.980
Give this notebook
to our Guild's young ones.

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:16.980
We'll buy some time so you can run.

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:20.940
Protect them. And fight with them!

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:24.520
You're telling us to die here?

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:27.600
Consider it done, Shiroe!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:30.100
I'm counting on you two!

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:37.480
A different monster in the east.
As expected, it's raid ranked.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:41.150
We need to find Adventurers
whose levels didn't get reduced.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.560
If this becomes a raid,
we're overwhelmingly shorthanded.

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:47.230
We lack information, too.

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:51.020
Information is essential
in order to win in a raid.

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:52.600
Your team members' fighting power,

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:55.060
their characteristics including
equipment and skills,

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:58.190
whether you have extra supplies
or not, battlefield terrain,

00:21:58.190 --> 00:22:02.150
and your foe's ability
and their behavior patterns...

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:04.850
What should I do to get more information?

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:07.690
Akatsuki!

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:09.840
What's the matter?

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:11.900
I see two people!

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.970
Lelia Mofur

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.970
Monk

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.970
Izumo Knights

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.970
Litka Mofur

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.970
Monk

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.970
Izumo Knights

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:15.150
Level 65! It's Lelia and Litka!

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:18.650
Minori!

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:20.190
Akatsuki!

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:22.730
Shiro-Shiro said...!

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:24.020
Shiroe?!

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:28.520
He asked us to give this notebook to you.

00:22:28.520 --> 00:22:31.310
And he said to beat...

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:36.480
...the monsters who're over there!

00:24:12.940 --> 00:24:17.600
We used to just wait for someone
to extend their hands to help us,

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:19.350
but that's no longer the case.

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:23.100
We have the power and courage to fight,
as well as irreplaceable comrades.

00:24:23.100 --> 00:24:25.900
Now the young Adventurers
challenge the raid

00:24:25.900 --> 00:24:29.770
in order to open the doors
with their own hands and move forward.

00:24:29.770 --> 00:24:36.990
Next Time

00:24:29.770 --> 00:24:36.990
Despair Genius

00:24:29.770 --> 00:24:32.150
Next Time: "Despair Genius."

00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:34.940
When things go past the
breaking point, rules change!
